	<div class="row bg-light p-6 rounded-5 mb-18">
		<div class="column p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18">
			<div class="pvlRichtext" style="text-align:center"><h2 style="text-align: left;">Sponsor a Red Kettle in Greenville</h2>
<p style="text-align: left;">Businesses and civic organizations are invited to sponsor a Red Kettle in Greenville this Christmas and help support our mission all year long. Contact <a href="mailto://justin.heisey@uss.salvationarmy.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Justin Heisey </a>for more information.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong>Matching Opportunities</strong></span><br><strong></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>November 13-14</strong></p>
<ul style="text-align: left;">
<li>Matching Cap of $10,000 across both days</li>
<li>Up to 40+ locations across both dates</li>
<li>Live television coverage on November 13</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>Monday-Thursday (Beginning after Black Friday)</strong></p>
<ul style="text-align: left;">
<li>Matching Cap of $5,000</li>
<li>Up to 30 locations</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>Friday and Saturday (Beginning on Black Friday)</strong></p>
<ul style="text-align: left;">
<li>Matching Cap of $7,000</li>
<li>Up to 40 locations</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong>Organizations Receive</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-size: 16px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Logo inclusion on all participating kettles on the matching date (min 20, max 40)</span></li>
<li style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Social media posts in the lead-up and on the matching date</span></li>
<li style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Personalized corporate poster promoting your matching donation</span></li>
<li style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Logo inclusion on a thank-you ad in the Community Journal</span></li>
</ul></div>
