<h5><strong>Angel Tree in Greenville</strong></h5>
<p>Visit our Angel Tree page to learn more about how you can help support Greenville families in need at Christmas.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/usa-southern-territory/north-and-south-carolina/greenville-sc-area-command/greenville-county-sc-angel-tree/">Angel Tree</a></p></div>
